  },
  "evidencePolicy": [
    "Passing original bounded-study tests is evidence only for that study; it does not validate the new application.",
    "A complete Git tree and file catalogue are not a complete documented-feature inventory.",
    "Selected overview review is not full review of the selected document or its linked API contracts.",
    "Never infer a complete-product release from a component version; source manifests are evidence of a development version, not necessarily a shipped build.",
    "No coverage percentage is reported until the feature denominator and edition/platform scope are closed.",
    "Every capability below remains an open parity gate, including those with passing local core tests."
  ],
